title: "GladeShell: Ultra-High-Performance Modular Shell Environment and Prompt Engine"
abstract: "GladeShell is a pure-Rust, zero-fork modular shell environment, sub-millisecond dynamic prompt kit, and native cross-platform terminal utility suite built with type safety, memory security, and multi-core efficiency."
